<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1368208276"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1489350663"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Call You Mine"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Chainsmokers / Bebe Rexha"/><amll:meta key="album" value="World War Joy...Takeaway"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:37.640"><div begin="00:09.439" end="03:33.536"><p begin="00:09.439" end="00:11.409" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Two kids with their hearts on fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过是两个为爱冲动的孩子啊</span></p><p begin="00:11.574" end="00:13.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Who's gonna save us now?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻有谁能拯救我们呢</span></p><p begin="00:14.058" end="00:16.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">When we thought that we couldn't get higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原以为我们已经足够幸福</span></p><p begin="00:16.183" end="00:17.948" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Things started looking down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁料曾经激情开始褪却</span></p><p begin="00:18.655" end="00:20.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I look at you and you look at me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我凝视着你 你回望着我</span></p><p begin="00:20.572" end="00:22.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Like nothin' but strangers now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">四目相对的我们像是陌生的过客</span></p><p begin="00:23.357" end="00:25.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Two kids with their hearts on fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过是两个为爱冲动的孩子啊</span></p><p begin="00:25.437" end="00:27.032" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Don't let it burn us out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要让最后的爱焚毁殆尽</span></p><p begin="00:27.136" end="00:29.723" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Think about what you believe in now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就想想此刻你仍坚信的爱吧</span></p><p begin="00:29.839" end="00:32.097" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Am I someone you cannot live without?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否还是你生命的全部意义？</span></p><p begin="00:32.240" end="00:35.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">'Cause I know I don't wanna live without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道没有你的生活我难以为继</span></p><p begin="00:35.442" end="00:36.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托 就让我们竭力挽回吧</span></p><p begin="00:36.324" end="00:39.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Come on let's turn this all around</p><p begin="00:39.275" end="00:41.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Bring it all back to that bar downtown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让一切重回至我们在市中心那间酒吧的那刻吧</span></p><p begin="00:41.442" end="00:44.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">When you wouldn't let me walk out on you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时的你不愿让我离开你</span></p><p begin="00:44.685" end="00:45.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你问我 余生你有何计划</span></p><p begin="00:45.555" end="00:49.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">You said, "Hey, what ya doing for the rest of your life?"</p><p begin="00:50.072" end="00:50.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">And I said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我回道 我连今晚该做什么都不知道</span></p><p begin="00:51.045" end="00:54.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">"I don't even know what I'm doing tonight"</p><p begin="00:54.781" end="00:59.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Went from one conversation to your lips on mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我对话的你的唇贴近了我的唇</span></p><p begin="00:59.873" end="01:03.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">And you said, "I never regretted the day that I called you mine"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你不曾后悔你专属于我的那些时光</span></p><p begin="01:03.723" end="01:05.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">So I call you mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我说你是我的专属</span></p><p begin="01:12.976" end="01:14.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Can I call you mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说你是我的专属么？</span></p><p begin="01:18.309" end="01:22.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">And you said, "I never regretted the day that I called you mine"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你不曾后悔你专属于我的那些时光</span></p><p begin="01:23.354" end="01:25.375" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Broke kids running through the city<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心碎的我们游荡于霓虹之间</span></p><p begin="01:25.417" end="01:27.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Drunk on the subway train<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醉倒于地铁上</span></p><p begin="01:27.910" end="01:29.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Set free every time you kissed me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次你亲吻我的时候 心仿佛不禁飞扬</span></p><p begin="01:30.067" end="01:31.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">We couldn't feel no pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们感受不到任何伤痛</span></p><p begin="01:32.409" end="01:34.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">You looked at me and I looked at you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你注视着我 我凝视着你</span></p><p begin="01:34.372" end="01:36.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Like we'd never look away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">四目相对的我们像是谁也不曾移离目光</span></p><p begin="01:37.199" end="01:39.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Broke kids running through the city<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心碎的我们游荡于霓虹之间</span></p><p begin="01:39.282" end="01:40.909" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Don't let the memory fade<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要让我们的回忆沦为逝去的曾经</span></p><p begin="01:40.938" end="01:45.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">You said, "Hey, what ya doing for the rest of your life?"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你问我 余生你有何计划</span></p><p begin="01:45.405" end="01:46.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">And I said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我回道 我连今晚该做什么都不知道</span></p><p begin="01:46.467" end="01:49.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">"I don't even know what I'm doing tonight"</p><p begin="01:50.109" end="01:54.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Went from one conversation to your lips on mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我对话的你的唇贴近了我的唇</span></p><p begin="01:55.286" end="01:58.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">And you said, "I never regretted the day that I called you mine"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你不曾后悔你专属于我的那些时光</span></p><p begin="01:59.129" end="02:00.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">So I call you mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我说你是我的专属</span></p><p begin="02:08.366" end="02:09.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Can I call you mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说你是我的专属么？</span></p><p begin="02:13.716" end="02:17.409" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">And you said, "I never regretted the day that I called you mine"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你不曾后悔你专属于我的那些时光</span></p><p begin="02:17.892" end="02:20.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Think about what you believe in now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就想想此刻你仍坚信的爱吧</span></p><p begin="02:20.652" end="02:22.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Am I someone you cannot live without?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否还是你生命的全部意义？</span></p><p begin="02:22.983" end="02:25.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">'Cause I know I don't wanna live without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道没有你的生活我难以为继</span></p><p begin="02:26.244" end="02:26.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托 就让我们竭力挽回吧</span></p><p begin="02:27.132" end="02:29.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Come on let's turn this all around</p><p begin="02:30.026" end="02:32.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Bring it all back to that bar downtown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让一切重回至我们在市中心那间酒吧的那刻吧</span></p><p begin="02:32.236" end="02:35.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">When you wouldn't let me walk out on you, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时的你不愿让我离开你</span></p><p begin="02:36.323" end="02:40.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">You said, "Hey, whatcha doing for the rest of your life?"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你问我 余生你有何计划</span></p><p begin="02:40.824" end="02:41.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">And I said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我回道 我连今晚该做什么都不知道</span></p><p begin="02:41.793" end="02:45.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">"I don't even know what I'm doing tonight"</p><p begin="02:45.570" end="02:49.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Went from one conversation to your lips on mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我对话的你的唇贴近了我的唇</span></p><p begin="02:50.641" end="02:54.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">And you said, "I never regretted the day that I called you mine"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你不曾后悔你专属于我的那些时光</span></p><p begin="02:54.497" end="02:55.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">So I call you mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我说你是我的专属</span></p><p begin="02:59.815" end="03:03.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">And you said, "I never regretted the day that I called you mine"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你不曾后悔你专属于我的那些时光</span></p><p begin="03:03.782" end="03:05.145" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">Can I call you mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说你是我的专属么？</span></p><p begin="03:12.982" end="03:15.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">Can I call you mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说你是我的专属么？</span></p><p begin="03:22.206" end="03:23.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">Can I call you mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说你是我的专属么？</span></p><p begin="03:31.437" end="03:33.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">Can I call you mine?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说你是我的专属么？</span></p></div></body></tt>